    LLM: '1. Must follow suit. If unable, you can trump or discard.\n2. **StÃ¶ck**: Holding the King and Ober of the trump suit (20 pts).\n3. **Weis**: Melds declared during the first trick (e.g., four of a kind, sequences).',
